flowchart LR
    %% J2 Payout: approval to settlement (documentary; the code is the source of truth)
    Approve[PUT /v1/claims/id/approve] --> ApprovalSvc[ClaimApprovalService.approve]
    ApprovalSvc --> Calc[ClaimSettlementCalculator]
    Calc --> Approved>claims.approved.v1]
    Approved --> Consumer[payments-gateway ApprovedClaimConsumer]
    Consumer --> Pay[PayoutService.Pay]
    Pay --> ClearRiver[ClearRiver Bank Payouts]
    ClearRiver --> Payment[(claims.payment)]
    Payment --> Settled>payments.settled.v1]
    Settled --> Listener[PaymentSettledListener marks PAID]
